Specifications
--------------

MQTT-SN 1.2 (IBM, 2013) and the OASIS MQTT-SN 2.0 Committee
Specification Draft 01 are not redistributed. Packet types, field
layouts, codes and the draft's protection scheme numbers are facts,
written in our own words with clause references; no text of either
document is reproduced.

Trademarks
